      <!-- ===== THEOLOGICAL CONTEXT: A LIFE OF TOTAL REFORMATION ===== -->
      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="sh-eyebrow">From the Quarterdeck to the Reformation</div>
          <h2>A Life Transformed by the Word of God</h2>
          <p>Captain Bates&rsquo; autobiography is not merely a history &mdash; it is a living argument that the God of heaven meets men exactly as they are, leads them step by step, and requires total consecration before total light.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="life-card">
